@startuml NexovCare_Voice_Agent_Workflow
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica", "Arial", sans-serif
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #0284C7
    ActorBorderColor #0284C7
    LifeLineBorderColor #CBD5E1
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
    ParticipantBorderColor #0284C7
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #F0F9FF
    ParticipantFontColor #0F172A
    ParticipantFontStyle bold
    BoxBorderColor #94A3B8
    BoxBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
}

skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #FEF3C7
    BorderColor #F59E0B
    FontColor #92400E
}

title NexovCare Hospital - Voice AI Workflow & Pipeline Architecture

actor "Patient / Caller" as Patient #E0F2FE
participant "Browser Call Console" as Browser #E0F2FE
participant "WebSocket Gateway\n(/ws/call)" as Gateway #F0F9FF
participant "Silero VAD\n(ONNX Runtime)" as VAD #F0F9FF
participant "ElevenLabs STT\n(Real-Time)" as STT #F0F9FF
participant "Google Gemini 3.5\nFlash Lite (LLM)" as LLM #FEF9C3
participant "Pipecat Tools\n(tools.py)" as Tools #FEF9C3
database "JSON Store\n(clinic_data.json)" as DB #ECFDF5
participant "ElevenLabs TTS\n(Neural Bella)" as TTS #FDF2F8
participant "Live Dashboard\n(/ws Broadcast)" as Dashboard #ECFDF5

== 1. Call Connection & Full-Duplex Pipeline Initialization ==

Patient -> Browser : Clicks Start Call
activate Browser
Browser -> Gateway : Connect WebSocket (/ws/call)
activate Gateway
Gateway -> TTS : Synthesize Welcome Greeting
activate TTS
TTS -> Gateway : Stream 24kHz PCM Audio Frames
deactivate TTS
Gateway -> Browser : Binary Audio Stream
Browser -> Patient : Speaks welcome greeting to caller

== 2. Natural Voice Query & Voice Activity Detection ==

Patient -> Browser : Speaks: I would like to book Dr. Sarah Jenkins tomorrow
Browser -> Gateway : Stream 16kHz 16-bit Mono PCM
Gateway -> VAD : Stream raw audio frames
activate VAD
VAD -> VAD : Detect End-of-Speech boundary
VAD -> STT : Forward speech frame chunk
deactivate VAD
activate STT
STT -> Gateway : Transcribed text
deactivate STT

Gateway -> Dashboard : Broadcast user transcript event
Dashboard -> Dashboard : Render caller message in live transcript feed

== 3. Conversational Reasoning & Availability Check ==

Gateway -> LLM : User utterance + conversational history + tools
activate LLM
LLM -> Tools : check_doctor_availability(doctor_name, date)
activate Tools
Tools -> DB : Query active doctor slots and leave status
activate DB
DB --> Tools : Return matching slots
deactivate DB

alt Doctor is On Leave (e.g. Dr. David Miller)
    Tools --> LLM : Doctor is on scheduled leave (0 slots available)
    LLM -> TTS : Synthesize: Dr. Miller is on leave. Would you like another specialist?
    activate TTS
    TTS -> Gateway : 24kHz PCM stream
    deactivate TTS
    Gateway -> Browser : Binary audio frames
    Browser -> Patient : Informs caller doctor is on leave
else Doctor is Available (e.g. Dr. Sarah Jenkins)
    Tools --> LLM : Available slots found (09:00 AM, 10:30 AM, 02:00 PM)
    LLM -> TTS : Synthesize: Dr. Jenkins has slots at 9:00 AM, 10:30 AM, 2:00 PM. Which works?
    activate TTS
    TTS -> Gateway : 24kHz PCM stream
    deactivate TTS
    Gateway -> Browser : Binary audio frames
    Browser -> Patient : Speaks available slots to caller
end
deactivate Tools
deactivate LLM

== 4. Slot Selection & Mandatory Phone Read-Back Confirmation ==

Patient -> Browser : Speaks: 10:30 AM. My phone number is 9876543210
Browser -> Gateway : Stream audio frames
Gateway -> VAD : Voice frame detection
activate VAD
VAD -> STT : Forward speech chunk
deactivate VAD
activate STT
STT -> Gateway : Transcribed: 10:30 AM, phone 9876543210
deactivate STT

Gateway -> LLM : Transcribed slot choice and phone number
activate LLM

note over LLM, Patient
  Clinical Guardrail:
  The agent MUST read back the phone number
  and require explicit caller confirmation
  prior to executing database mutations.
end note

LLM -> TTS : Synthesize: Confirming 10:30 AM. Phone is 98765-43210. Is that correct?
activate TTS
TTS -> Gateway : 24kHz PCM stream
deactivate TTS
Gateway -> Browser : Binary audio frames
Browser -> Patient : Speaks read-back verification

Patient -> Browser : Speaks: Yes, that is correct
Browser -> Gateway : Stream confirmation audio
Gateway -> VAD : Voice frame detection
activate VAD
VAD -> STT : Forward speech chunk
deactivate VAD
activate STT
STT -> Gateway : Transcribed: Yes, that is correct
deactivate STT
Gateway -> LLM : Confirmed by caller

== 5. Booking Execution & Real-Time Dashboard Sync ==

LLM -> Tools : book_appointment(phone, doctor, time, date)
activate Tools
Tools -> DB : Mark slot booked, write appointment record
activate DB
DB --> Tools : Booking confirmed (APT-XXXX)
deactivate DB
Tools --> LLM : Return success and appointment payload
deactivate Tools

LLM -> TTS : Synthesize: Consultation confirmed for tomorrow at 10:30 AM
activate TTS
TTS -> Gateway : 24kHz PCM stream
deactivate TTS
deactivate LLM

Gateway -> Browser : Binary audio frames
Browser -> Patient : Speaks booking confirmation

Gateway -> Dashboard : Broadcast appointment_created event via /ws
activate Dashboard
Dashboard -> Dashboard : Decrement doctor open slot badge\nAppend new row to Patient Appointment Ledger in real time
deactivate Dashboard

== 6. Multi-Appointment Cancellation Flow (Disambiguation) ==

opt Patient Calls to Cancel Consultation
    Patient -> Browser : Speaks: I want to cancel my appointment
    Browser -> Gateway : Stream audio
    Gateway -> VAD : Audio frames
    activate VAD
    VAD -> STT : Speech chunk
    deactivate VAD
    activate STT
    STT -> Gateway : Transcribed cancellation request
    deactivate STT
    Gateway -> LLM : Caller wants to cancel
    activate LLM
    LLM -> TTS : Synthesize: Please provide your registered phone number
    activate TTS
    TTS -> Gateway : Stream audio
    deactivate TTS
    Gateway -> Browser : Audio frames
    Browser -> Patient : Asks caller for phone number

    Patient -> Browser : Speaks: 9876543210
    Browser -> Gateway : Stream audio
    Gateway -> VAD : Audio frames
    activate VAD
    VAD -> STT : Speech chunk
    deactivate VAD
    activate STT
    STT -> Gateway : Transcribed: 9876543210
    deactivate STT
    Gateway -> LLM : Caller phone number

    LLM -> Tools : Query appointments for phone 9876543210
    activate Tools
    Tools -> DB : Fetch all active bookings for 9876543210
    activate DB
    DB --> Tools : Return active bookings list
    deactivate DB
    Tools --> LLM : Return appointments list
    deactivate Tools

    alt Multiple Active Bookings Found
        note over LLM, Patient
          Multi-Appointment Disambiguation:
          Agent detects 2 or more bookings under the same phone
          and asks the caller to specify which one to cancel.
        end note
        LLM -> TTS : Synthesize: Found 2 appointments. Which one would you like to cancel?
        activate TTS
        TTS -> Gateway : Stream audio
        deactivate TTS
        Gateway -> Browser : Audio frames
        Browser -> Patient : Reads matching appointments
        Patient -> Browser : Speaks: Cancel the one with Dr. Jenkins
        Browser -> Gateway : Stream selection
        Gateway -> VAD : Audio frames
        activate VAD
        VAD -> STT : Speech chunk
        deactivate VAD
        activate STT
        STT -> Gateway : Transcribed selection
        deactivate STT
        Gateway -> LLM : Selected appointment
    end

    LLM -> TTS : Synthesize: Confirming cancellation for Dr. Jenkins. Correct?
    activate TTS
    TTS -> Gateway : Stream audio
    deactivate TTS
    Gateway -> Browser : Audio frames
    Browser -> Patient : Reads back cancellation confirmation
    Patient -> Browser : Speaks: Yes

    LLM -> Tools : cancel_appointment(phone, doctor, time, date)
    activate Tools
    Tools -> DB : Set is_booked=false, update appointment status to cancelled
    activate DB
    DB --> Tools : Cancellation confirmed
    deactivate DB
    Tools --> LLM : Return success
    deactivate Tools

    LLM -> TTS : Synthesize: Your appointment has been cancelled successfully
    activate TTS
    TTS -> Gateway : Stream audio
    deactivate TTS
    deactivate LLM
    Gateway -> Browser : Audio frames
    Browser -> Patient : Speaks cancellation confirmation

    Gateway -> Dashboard : Broadcast appointment_cancelled event via /ws
    activate Dashboard
    Dashboard -> Dashboard : Increment doctor open slot count\nUpdate status to Cancelled in Patient Ledger
    deactivate Dashboard
end

== 7. Call Teardown ==

Patient -> Browser : Clicks End Call or hangs up
Browser -> Gateway : Close WebSocket connection
deactivate Browser
Gateway -> Gateway : Teardown Pipecat audio pipeline
deactivate Gateway

@enduml
